				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				1026
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Pk.</u>
				382
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Anacreont.</u>
				12.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέκνοισι Ζῆν᾽ ἄβουλον</span>
			<i>taking no thought</i> for them, <i>unfeeling,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				140
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
