				Th.
				1.120.7
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Dio</u>
				43
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.71
				</span></i>
